A||||24||ginoferrari||Autocross||||5||
Z||000000||ginoferrari||07-15-2001||07:11 PM||||I'm new to the site and am thinking about starting to run my 2M4 in the local autox. I went to watch a couple weeks ago and there was only one Fiero that ran. He was driving a 2M6 with a 3800 conversion. He did so bad it made Fiero's look bad, I think everyone beat his time even the VW's. I'm sure I could beat his time with my bare bones stock 2M4 but would like to give some of the other cars a run for there money. I know I will have to make some changes but would like to not go through the trial and error process. Any help I could get from the folks on this site would be greatly appreciated.||||reg||5
